WEBVTT

00:00:01.381 --> 00:00:13.259
Yes, I embraced tenderness and devotion
sou itooshisa to kizuna wo daita

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.956
Floating in unending space
hatenaki umi ni ukabu

00:00:18.999 --> 00:00:25.905
On this small planet
chiisa na hoshi de

00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:37.442
When I feel your warmth next to me
anata no nukumori wo soba ni kanjiru toki

00:00:37.617 --> 00:00:43.556
I understand the burden
inochi no omosa to

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:50.962
And the transience of life
hakanasa wo shiru no

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:58.772
Nights of sorrowful wandering
mayoinageku yoru mo

00:00:58.772 --> 00:01:05.645
And tearful mornings
namida no asa mo

00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:11.251
I believe in tomorrow
ashita wo shinjiru kara

00:01:11.251 --> 00:01:17.524
So I can make it through
koeteyukeru no

00:01:17.524 --> 00:01:25.954
To the continuation of the dream
yume no tsuzuki he

00:01:54.194 --> 00:01:59.154
REVOLVING LIVES

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:03.763
Helga! The color of her hair!

00:02:07.841 --> 00:02:10.071
Her eyes...

00:02:11.211 --> 00:02:14.237
Her eyes have turned blue.

00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:22.679
Princess.

00:02:23.523 --> 00:02:25.354
Helga?

00:02:26.193 --> 00:02:28.286
Are you okay?

00:02:39.673 --> 00:02:42.005
What happened to Soran?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:57.151
If you want the experimental
data on the pilots, that must mean...

00:02:57.757 --> 00:03:00.527
that you've found Tina, right?
Hesma.

00:03:00.527 --> 00:03:02.324
Dumas!

00:03:05.665 --> 00:03:07.267
Dumas?!

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:11.805
So then you're also one
of the Children of Befort,

00:03:11.805 --> 00:03:13.796
Demian?!

00:03:15.408 --> 00:03:18.775
This is what you want,
isn't it, Hesma?

00:03:20.046 --> 00:03:22.310
Accelerated aging.

00:03:23.383 --> 00:03:26.716
The destruction of DNA
because of a special enzyme.

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:32.152
And they all died
within three years.

00:03:32.893 --> 00:03:35.061
Three years?

00:03:35.061 --> 00:03:38.365
Even if you return to Greecia, you'll
only have about two months to live.

00:03:38.365 --> 00:03:39.733
What did you say?!

00:03:39.733 --> 00:03:43.203
Transferring a soul back to the
same body is tragic, isn't it, Hesma?

00:03:43.203 --> 00:03:46.866
You're also going to return to
your original body, aren't you?

00:03:48.141 --> 00:03:52.703
Two months...
Only two months to live?

00:03:55.782 --> 00:03:57.817
Don't worry, Hesma.

00:03:57.817 --> 00:04:00.183
I've already found
a way to treat it.

00:04:01.221 --> 00:04:04.782
W-What did you say?!
You've found a way to treat it?

00:04:04.991 --> 00:04:08.595
H-How can that be? Why didn't
you say something sooner?!

00:04:08.595 --> 00:04:11.131
I don't have any interest in
the people of Earth.

00:04:11.131 --> 00:04:14.634
I was just putting the results of
your experiments to good use.

00:04:14.634 --> 00:04:18.305
Demian, are you also
from another world?

00:04:18.305 --> 00:04:20.440
Is that the reason you don't get older?

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.109
I'm getting older, Professor Gherta.

00:04:23.109 --> 00:04:26.913
Twenty years here is equal to
one year on the planet Greecia.

00:04:26.913 --> 00:04:29.716
The size of the planet,
the difference in the atmosphere,

00:04:29.716 --> 00:04:32.052
and the physical size of living things.

00:04:32.052 --> 00:04:34.888
It was very difficult to
adjust to all that.

00:04:34.888 --> 00:04:38.688
It also took a lot of work to get close
to the royal family of this country.

00:04:39.192 --> 00:04:43.151
What are you going to do, Hesma?
Will you cooperate with me?

00:04:53.707 --> 00:04:55.575
Come on, Hesma.

00:04:55.575 --> 00:04:58.100
There's something I want to show you.

00:05:00.413 --> 00:05:02.904
Wait! Demian!

00:05:03.617 --> 00:05:04.951
Demian.

00:05:04.951 --> 00:05:10.583
In other words, this means that I've
just been used by you aliens?

00:05:11.057 --> 00:05:12.325
Used?

00:05:12.325 --> 00:05:14.494
You scientists are the ones
who wanted to...

00:05:14.494 --> 00:05:16.429
know about
the world of death.

00:05:16.429 --> 00:05:19.466
Don't worry, I won't interfere
with your experiment.

00:05:19.466 --> 00:05:22.369
I'll even bring you a pilot
to put on board soon.

00:05:22.369 --> 00:05:24.270
This is Earth!

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:26.006
It is our planet.

00:05:26.006 --> 00:05:28.708
I don't know what you people's
motives are, and until I do...

00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:30.710
Until you do?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:32.541
What are you trying to say?

00:05:42.222 --> 00:05:43.923
Let me out!

00:05:43.923 --> 00:05:46.493
Let me out! Please!

00:05:46.493 --> 00:05:49.663
Let me out! Let me out!

00:05:49.663 --> 00:05:52.530
Please let me out!

00:05:52.866 --> 00:05:55.494
Let me out!

00:06:01.074 --> 00:06:03.474
You can't run away from me.

00:06:09.516 --> 00:06:12.919
Gherta, I'll tell you one thing.

00:06:12.919 --> 00:06:17.652
It's you who is one of them.

00:06:22.162 --> 00:06:25.723
When it happened,
you were all there too.

00:06:26.499 --> 00:06:29.468
Tell me, what happened to Soran?

00:06:30.236 --> 00:06:33.000
At that time,
Gueroca's rebel army...

00:06:34.007 --> 00:06:38.341
Princess Tina, in order to steal your
body, they forced into Tanatalum.

00:06:40.547 --> 00:06:44.108
By the time we realized what
had happened, both of them were...

00:06:44.751 --> 00:06:47.379
Both Lord Seth and Soran
had been killed.

00:06:49.689 --> 00:06:51.657
Both of them...

00:07:11.211 --> 00:07:12.940
Soran.

00:07:15.949 --> 00:07:17.883
Seth.

00:07:19.853 --> 00:07:23.311
I see, Soran was killed.

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:28.350
And Seth, too.
Everyone died because of me.

00:07:30.029 --> 00:07:33.795
When I was Serafine,
it was kind Jim.

00:07:34.734 --> 00:07:38.170
And Christina's student,
little Arnon.

00:07:44.978 --> 00:07:46.346
Helga.

00:07:46.346 --> 00:07:48.576
Thank you, Chitto.

00:07:51.117 --> 00:07:54.052
But I'm fine now.

00:07:58.424 --> 00:08:03.730
Chitto, you've been
helping me all this time.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.532
Thank you.

00:08:05.532 --> 00:08:07.727
I'm all right now.

00:08:07.901 --> 00:08:11.894
From now on, you have to think
about yourself more, Chitto.

00:08:22.482 --> 00:08:24.109
Tina.

00:08:24.851 --> 00:08:27.115
Seth.

00:08:27.387 --> 00:08:29.252
Soran.

00:08:41.401 --> 00:08:42.993
Thoma.

00:09:09.429 --> 00:09:11.522
Thoma.

00:09:15.068 --> 00:09:17.093
Thoma.

00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:25.678
Princess Tina, please tell us
what you want to do.

00:09:25.678 --> 00:09:31.050
The king said he wanted you to return
to Greecia's Zone, if possible.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.654
The only thing we and the king can do
to make up for what happened,

00:09:34.654 --> 00:09:38.146
is to return you to the sky
of your homeland.

00:09:38.391 --> 00:09:40.951
To the sky of the planet Greecia.

00:09:43.997 --> 00:09:45.899
Thank you.

00:09:45.899 --> 00:09:48.868
But I won't go back.

00:09:51.371 --> 00:09:55.842
I made a promise to Soran,
that I would always wait for him.

00:09:55.842 --> 00:09:58.470
And Soran promised that
he would come.

00:09:58.711 --> 00:10:00.780
That's why I'll wait here,

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.149
on this planet, for Soran.

00:10:03.149 --> 00:10:07.353
But Princess Tina, Soran didn't
get into the Out Zone.

00:10:07.353 --> 00:10:09.821
He won't be able to come here.

00:10:11.024 --> 00:10:13.652
Serafine's life...

00:10:14.527 --> 00:10:16.961
Christina's life...

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:22.435
They were always waiting for
something, searching for something.

00:10:22.435 --> 00:10:24.767
Precious life.

00:10:28.107 --> 00:10:31.201
The soul I have here and now,

00:10:31.477 --> 00:10:36.312
no longer belongs to Tina alone.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.052
I won't go back.

00:10:47.226 --> 00:10:49.529
Those people's lives...

00:10:49.529 --> 00:10:52.598
To make sure I don't lose the proof
that I lived them,

00:10:52.598 --> 00:10:54.793
I'll wait for Soran.

00:10:55.335 --> 00:11:01.374
But Serafine lived a lonely life
and died in that sanatorium.

00:11:01.374 --> 00:11:03.943
She didn't have a happy life.

00:11:03.943 --> 00:11:06.446
Princess Tina,
is that what you want?

00:11:06.446 --> 00:11:10.950
Both Serafine and Christina lived out
their lives believing in what Soran said.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:15.148
And now I'm the same way, too.

00:11:15.722 --> 00:11:18.358
I'm definitely not unhappy.

00:11:18.358 --> 00:11:21.623
That's what you want then,
Princess Tina?

00:11:22.795 --> 00:11:26.162
Aghi, I'm Helga now.

00:11:28.067 --> 00:11:29.902
I understand.

00:11:29.902 --> 00:11:33.998
That is the clear, decisive answer
we wanted to hear.

00:12:05.138 --> 00:12:07.040
Tina's rebirth?

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:08.975
Afterwards, on Greecia,

00:12:08.975 --> 00:12:13.379
King Titus drove back Gueroca's
army until it was completely destroyed.

00:12:13.379 --> 00:12:15.281
But it was too late.

00:12:15.281 --> 00:12:17.183
Gueroca had already
stolen Princess Tina's body,

00:12:17.183 --> 00:12:19.852
and the transfer data from Tanatulum.

00:12:19.852 --> 00:12:22.286
So, he learned about this planet.

00:12:22.789 --> 00:12:24.590
Tina's body...

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.261
In order to get revenge, he was going
to transfer your soul, Helga,

00:12:28.261 --> 00:12:31.890
so he could once again
activate that weapon.

00:12:33.166 --> 00:12:35.031
Me?

00:12:35.234 --> 00:12:36.736
That's right.

00:12:36.736 --> 00:12:40.103
Princess Tina's younger brother,
Dumas, is looking for you.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.432
Dumas?

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.704
He is the child of Lord Gueroca
and Lady Reda.

00:12:49.849 --> 00:12:52.652
Tina's younger brother.

00:12:52.652 --> 00:12:56.850
Helga, if you don't want to
return to Greecia's Zone,

00:12:56.923 --> 00:12:59.659
then we have to prevent
the rebirth of Princess Tina!

00:12:59.659 --> 00:13:02.962
Hasmodye! Tarlant!
You two protect Helga!

00:13:02.962 --> 00:13:05.431
Soreto! You and I will
go after Hesma,

00:13:05.431 --> 00:13:07.922
and destroy the transference device
they have here!

00:13:18.711 --> 00:13:20.746
Chitto, don't cry anymore.

00:13:20.746 --> 00:13:26.343
Helga! I'm going to
stay with you forever!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.720
Chitto.

00:13:32.992 --> 00:13:35.927
W-What's wrong with me?

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:49.805
Helga!

00:13:56.816 --> 00:13:58.784
Who are these guys?!

00:14:11.964 --> 00:14:13.795
Dumas!

00:14:16.769 --> 00:14:18.202
Helga.

00:14:18.571 --> 00:14:21.267
How do you know that name?

00:14:27.346 --> 00:14:29.314
Sister.

00:14:29.916 --> 00:14:32.885
What an unseemly form.

00:14:33.252 --> 00:14:37.348
Dumas, you are Tina's little brother?

00:14:42.795 --> 00:14:45.264
Chitto! Take Helga and
get out of here!

00:14:45.264 --> 00:14:47.528
Quick! Helga!

00:15:10.256 --> 00:15:12.121
How do you like that?!

00:15:21.234 --> 00:15:23.725
What is this thing?!

00:15:43.322 --> 00:15:45.756
Wonder, go rescue Helga!

00:16:15.121 --> 00:16:17.919
I came to get you, Big Sister.

00:16:18.257 --> 00:16:20.452
Let's go home together.

00:16:21.761 --> 00:16:24.161
Don't talk stupid!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.563
Thoma!

00:16:32.138 --> 00:16:34.072
Thoma!

00:16:38.411 --> 00:16:40.402
Helga!

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.245
-Helga!
-Wonder!

00:16:52.658 --> 00:16:54.626
Don't lose them, Wonder!

00:17:04.904 --> 00:17:08.441
Unbelievable! Even an idiot
wouldn't do something like that!

00:17:08.441 --> 00:17:10.509
This time we really will get killed!

00:17:10.509 --> 00:17:12.645
This place is the only lead I have.

00:17:12.645 --> 00:17:16.282
If we can get in that Fragment room,
I'm sure we'll find out something.

00:17:16.282 --> 00:17:18.751
I was able to get you
released because

00:17:18.751 --> 00:17:21.454
I told the chief I would bring you
back within three days.

00:17:21.454 --> 00:17:23.115
Don't you understand that?

00:17:36.836 --> 00:17:39.038
They certainly were destructive.

00:17:39.038 --> 00:17:41.440
That Hesma!

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:44.409
As we thought, this is where they
were conducting their experiments.

00:17:50.282 --> 00:17:52.716
This place has already
been deserted.

00:17:53.185 --> 00:17:55.551
The transference device
must be somewhere else.

00:18:05.464 --> 00:18:09.668
Serafine's life...
Christina's life...

00:18:09.668 --> 00:18:14.002
They were always waiting for
something, searching for something.

00:18:14.273 --> 00:18:16.642
Precious life.

00:18:16.642 --> 00:18:19.545
The soul I have here and now,

00:18:19.545 --> 00:18:22.708
no longer belongs to Tina alone.

00:18:26.419 --> 00:18:28.717
The soul I have here,

00:18:29.054 --> 00:18:31.352
no longer belongs
to one person alone.

00:18:58.651 --> 00:18:59.552
Bel!

00:18:59.552 --> 00:19:02.919
Big Brother! Big Brother!
Big Brother Ian!

00:19:03.155 --> 00:19:04.918
Bel!

00:19:06.392 --> 00:19:09.462
I've been looking
for you all this time,

00:19:09.462 --> 00:19:12.829
but I couldn't find you anywhere!

00:19:14.033 --> 00:19:16.126
Bel, you're hurt!

00:19:17.503 --> 00:19:20.666
I fell down while I was
looking for you.

00:19:35.187 --> 00:19:37.621
Bel, are you all right?

00:19:43.796 --> 00:19:46.060
Aghi!

00:19:46.398 --> 00:19:49.492
Don't let yourself be taken in!
That's the Enma!

00:19:53.873 --> 00:19:56.809
But the Enma take the
appearance of the dead.

00:19:56.809 --> 00:19:59.545
It can't be that something happened
to my little sister?! Soreto!

00:19:59.545 --> 00:20:02.515
Something has happened to Bel!
To Bel physically!

00:20:02.515 --> 00:20:05.814
I have to go home, I have to go to
Bel's side! Get out of the way!

00:20:06.452 --> 00:20:09.655
You're wrong! You're wrong!
You have to calm down, Aghi!

00:20:09.655 --> 00:20:11.790
That attachment you have
to your little sister,

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:14.527
the Enma is just using the way
you feel to manipulate you!

00:20:14.527 --> 00:20:16.791
It doesn't only take
the forms of the dead!

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.960
Pull yourself together, Aghi!

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.269
Soreto.

00:20:23.269 --> 00:20:25.294
Big Brother.

00:20:45.858 --> 00:20:47.826
Aghi.

00:20:47.927 --> 00:20:52.990
Helga said that our soul no
longer belongs to just one person.

00:20:53.832 --> 00:20:56.435
We've gone through so many lives,

00:20:56.435 --> 00:21:00.172
during which we've met
people we grew close to,

00:21:00.172 --> 00:21:02.402
and come to the souls
we have now.

00:21:02.942 --> 00:21:08.147
We've all been reincarnated
21 times, and used 21 lives as tools.

00:21:08.147 --> 00:21:10.215
We've trampled on life.

00:21:10.215 --> 00:21:13.519
But, there was no other choice.

00:21:13.519 --> 00:21:15.454
If we hadn't done that...

00:21:15.454 --> 00:21:17.790
That's true, I understand that.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.859
But even though I understood,
I was suffering.

00:21:20.859 --> 00:21:23.293
The Enma is right in what it does.

00:21:23.596 --> 00:21:26.759
Its actions try to put us
back on the right path.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.531
And while we cut down that thing that's
right, we go on doing just the opposite.

00:21:32.805 --> 00:21:35.273
What does that make us?

00:21:36.875 --> 00:21:41.574
For the sake of just my one life,
I've made so many people suffer.

00:21:42.047 --> 00:21:45.073
But that will all come to an end soon.

00:21:47.753 --> 00:21:50.723
Our last responsibility
for the thing that we did.

00:21:50.723 --> 00:21:55.427
If we can't accomplish that, then we
really will be making everyone unhappy.

00:21:55.427 --> 00:21:56.985
Come on, Aghi.

00:21:58.597 --> 00:22:02.468
All the materials that were here
have been transferred to Kuril Island.

00:22:02.468 --> 00:22:04.069
Kuril Island.

00:22:04.069 --> 00:22:06.833
That's the place then.
That's where the transference device is.

00:22:35.768 --> 00:22:45.575
At the bottom of the deep, clear sea
fukaku fukaku sukitooru umi no soko ni

00:22:45.844 --> 00:22:55.688
A small flower is resting
chiisana hana madoronderu

00:22:55.688 --> 00:23:00.421
The melody of a gentle wind
amayaka na kaze no shirabe

00:23:00.459 --> 00:23:05.294
Passes through a rainbow
niji wo kuguri

00:23:05.698 --> 00:23:14.834
The fish are playing in the sky
sakanatachi wa sora ni asobu

00:23:14.940 --> 00:23:20.012
Everyone plays the music of love
dare mo ga ai wo kanaderu

00:23:20.012 --> 00:23:25.284
A warm light came down
atatakana hikari futteta

00:23:25.284 --> 00:23:29.687
(A gaze) That gaze
(manazashi wa) sono manazashi wa

00:23:29.722 --> 00:23:34.026
Is unbound and becomes full
hodokete michiteku

00:23:34.026 --> 00:23:38.895
Embraced by water
mizu ni dakare
